// M5-A3P-1014. Credits vignette CR "The beach rite" (in-engine, ~20 s). act3_ending.md §2 CR;
// toma_okeru.md Ending; ending_cost_audit §7. Dawn after the Unbinding, Haluna's beach, the village with their backs to
// the water and Toma among them. Only a few motes are left to rise, and he tends them anyway. IF ch18_haluna_lifted: no
// line (they already know how). IF UNSET: it opens with Toma teaching it, one line under the music (the sheet's line,
// verbatim). The last of the sea-glow, before E6's dark.
title: ending_beach_rite
location: ch02/haluna
---
@camera E12
@music credits_suite fade=2.0
<<if not $ch18_haluna_lifted>>
    Toma [tender]: Backs to the water. Like this. They go easier when nobody watches. #line:ending_beach_001
<<endif>>
@anim crowd turn_back sea
@vfx glimmer_lift at=beach_sea count=4 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 14.0
===
